{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_platnm_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_platnm_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "泡沫",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_platnm_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a5fa518038f29c8e785624bf2dae73bf083a8dcc75f50eb52805f80f9ecb5d2a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "罗德岛本舰\n博士办公室门口"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔？（哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞌睡都打完了，那家伙还没回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......下次直接在博士办公室里放写好的假条吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每次找人请假的时候都去开会，怎么会这样啊......早知道就不该答应做一段时间的助理......唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......发梢都有点遮眼睛了......讨厌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，博士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么一言不发地走进房间里了......生气了吗？我做了什么吗......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，应该是没被发现才对......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！博士，我在这里——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sanatorium_balcony"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sanatorium_balcony"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "山间湖水环绕的乌萨斯别墅。\n还有一座远在天边的高塔。\n直冲云霄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你来这里做什么，无胄盟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，耀骑士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这句话应该是我问你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在我也是罗德岛的一员，我当然可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这里可不是罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......说的也是呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，这里是哪里？那座塔又是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里......是让人休息的地方。至于那座塔，我想就得问你自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白金无言地望着那座高塔。\n阳光的反射使人看不清它的面目，又或是前所未有的角度令人一时间无法辨识。\n但它确实就在那里，在天边，如海市蜃楼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......商业联合会？那座楼什么时候如此之高了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们从未离开过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们也从来没有变过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这可不像耀骑士说的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......算了。我只是来找博士的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然博士不在这里，那么就恕我失陪——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "耀骑士没有说话，永远闪闪发光的冠军沉默地坐在那里，眺望着大地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你找博士做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来罗德岛也有一段时间了，只是想找机会享受一些个人时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这样啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从那道门出去吧，博士在那儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玻利瓦尔度假胜地。温度适宜服务又好，比北面的小木屋可舒服多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗伊......耀骑士之后，是你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别这样，说得好像我很烦人一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的关系也没那么差吧，小白金？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别这么拘谨，大家都是来这度假的。炎炎夏日，风情万种，可别被工作上的事扰了兴致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放轻松点，我给你拿些甜品吧。甜食对持续处于高压状态工作的人是有好处的，我相信你赞同这个观点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "服务员！拿份冰沙给这位小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "送到白金面前的冰沙让她有种似曾相识的感觉。\n杯中的冰沙被堆成大大小小的形状，还用果酱上了色。\n看上去就像——\n群山中的——\n疗养别墅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "度假的时候就别想着什么不愉快的东西了，它就在那里，你也改变不了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，只要它出现，你的注意力就会被夺走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那好不容易给你申请的长期休假岂不是一点用都没了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不你先回去一趟，解决了再回来度假，怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解决......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可就要问你自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题的，其他麻烦事包在我身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过你得快点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "罗伊指了指远方的光点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟大家都有害怕的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白金望向远方，那是三支绞在一起的玄铁巨箭，一边飞驰，一边在空中发出刺耳的啸声。\n很快，又不那么快。快到下一秒就会贯穿白金的身体，又慢到追不上街边路人的脚步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道怎么回大骑士领吧，小白金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的头发，我觉得还是黑色比较适合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "没等神情错愕的罗伊发出半点笑声，白金就转头跃入了水中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她对罗伊的反应不感兴趣，她只是想这么说一句。\n想了很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "骑探",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欣特莱雅小姐，欣特莱雅小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "骑探",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问您有兴趣来参加骑士海选吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不去理会身后紧紧追赶的骑探，白金向着商业联合会大楼疾驰而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G04"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在她的想象中，商业联合会里应该像大骑士领一样人头攒动。\n但这里只有雕像，各式各样的雕像，洁白纯净的雕像。\n前台的接待员、门口的警备员、走道里的工作人员......\n全部定格在了一个未知的时刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这下可难办了，我可没有前往董事活动区域的授权啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "电梯门打不开，楼梯间也进不去，暗道也被封死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "光芒顺着中央天井洒下，把整个一楼大厅照得光亮异常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我记得，我应该是天马来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "向着天空所在的方向，白金一跃而起。\n她没有如想象中那般落下，而是越升越高，越升越快，向着光芒的尽头飞去。\n温暖的阳光慢慢将她包裹——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑暗也随之降临。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白金小姐！请不要睡在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "睡得真熟啊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}，可算找到你了......费了我不少事啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "费事是指睡在走廊上吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什么都没看见，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是我把你喊醒的，怎么可能——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你什么都没看到，对、吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "假条？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我想请个长假。离开罗德岛，去远一些的地方，嗯，散散心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你会同意的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道说，博士......你想当我的旅伴吗？也不是不行吧，正好一起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "行啊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......哪件事？旅伴还是批假？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "两件事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "而且，现在就走。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是，至少得给我点时间打点行李......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你啊，就这点小小的愿望，已经拖延了多久了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等、等等——别拉我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "23_ex_telephonebooth"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "再次睁开双眼后，映入眼帘的是她最为熟悉，也最为厌恶的事物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是电话吗......唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这下就不会再——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "电话在上一刻被砸得粉碎，下一秒却又恢复如初，开始发出噪音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你就不能消停些吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还真是没完没了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拿起听筒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白金大位，你越界了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，是，真的很不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商业联合会的权威绝不允许你如此践踏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（把听筒放在一边）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想说就说个痛快吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请继续，我先在这休息一会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，没记错的话这里应该有藏酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈啊，果然......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（打开瓶塞）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（倒上半杯酒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在卡西米尔的夜空下，玄铁箭正在不断放大。\n如同流星一般划过夜空，大骑士领万家灯火也遮不住它的光芒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "23_ex_telephonebooth"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个是......苏打水？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来他们喝的不全是酒？呼......也行吧，毕竟我也不太喜欢这种酒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（倒上半杯苏打水）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬卡西米尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的，还有你们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（将苏打水倒在电话上）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "当水落在电话上时，听筒里传来激烈的咒骂声。但当苏打水全部浇下，电话发出一阵声响，再也没了声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，当箭射穿高塔后，会发生什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你似乎在期待些什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马克维茨，你怎么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "许久不见，白金大位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以回答你的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“当箭射穿高塔后，会发生什么呢？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么都不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真糟糕。我怎么会在梦里把你和博士弄混了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梦是不被自己控制的，欣特莱雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恰尔内",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以是任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你害怕的人。\n你可怜的人。\n你感兴趣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恰尔内",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们一起构成了你始终放不下的，你害怕的，那座塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恰尔内",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在那里长大，那里就是你的未来，你逃了出去，你还是觉得自己无处可去，你其实茫然无措。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白金无言地望向自己的梦境。\n应和着他的宣言，天花板向外翻开，露出卡西米尔联合会大楼的最上层。\n那里没有席位，也没有电话。\n只有如同树木一般，向着夜空无限延伸的枝节，照这势头生长下去，终有一日，日月都将被纳入其中。\n每一根枝节，都由不同材质打造而成。\n钢铁、报纸、木料、谷物。\n性质相异的物质在此处融为一体。\n而其中一节，充满利刺，遍布箭头，在风中发出刺耳呼啸。\n白金觉得自己站在一只巨兽的头颅上，它的羽翼伸向天空，它的根系深扎大地。\n它的骨骼用各种材质焊接，血管里则流动着各种纸币。\n而白金自己，也曾是其中一个微不足道的细胞。\n但现在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事实或许是这样，卡西米尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白金心中默念着一个人的名字，随后撞碎玻璃，从窗口跃下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G06"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再也别见了，卡西米尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还想过新生活呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，你接住了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就知道你能行，真可靠。总之也不是第一次了，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，这是哪儿呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来还有你也不知道的地方啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，先别把我放下来，我不太想动，让这个糟糕的梦早点结束吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正是梦，你也没什么损失，再多抱一会吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得集中思绪，清理下脑袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让卡西米尔那些奇怪的东西赶紧从我脑子里消失。"
